<BaseLayout title="Our Mission | J-Lo's Animal Rescue">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Our Mission</p><h1 class="section-title">From neglected to nourished. From alone to adored.</h1></div></section>
<section class="content-section"><div class="container" style="max-width:850px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.75;color:#413a36"><p>Founded by Jessica Lopez, a wife and mother of three, J-Lo Animal Rescue is a heartfelt life-long dream of Jessica’s that has blossomed into a life-saving reality in Albany, Ga.</p><p>What started as a mission to save several emaciated dogs discovered in a local backyard has grown into a thriving non-profit sanctuary that now provides a safe haven for over 60 dogs at a time.</p><p>We are dedicated to transforming lives through compassion and faith, ensuring that every animal in our care finds the love and dignity they deserve.</p><p><strong>Many of our pups are available for adoption!</strong></p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
